    "updated_at": "2019-10-01T03:06:46Z",
    "body": "Testing locally, it looks like the `time` module is respecting `prompt_order`.\r\n\r\nWhen setting the `prompt_order` make sure it is set before the headings of any other modules, so I'd suggest making it the first thing in your `starship.toml`.\r\n\r\nAs a test, could you please try setting your configuration to this?\r\n```toml\r\nprompt_order = [\r\n    \"time\",\r\n    \"line_break\",\r\n    \"character\",\r\n]\r\n```",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
